[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0010","text":"现在路加酱在里面上课──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0020","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0030","text":"打开门说“辛苦了”，\n然后递上慰问品，对吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0040","text":"嗯，那走吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0050","text":"预备──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0060","text":"辛苦了——……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0070","text":"────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0080","text":"那个——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0090","text":"啊……\n时间到了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0100","text":"啊……\n不、不是……时间还没到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0110","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0130","text":"……这个，我去送给她──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0140","text":"啊，羽那酱────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0150","text":"路加酱！\n这个，是慰问品──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0160","text":"白玉馅的鲷鱼烧──\n我买来了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0180","text":"不需要，这种东西。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0190","text":"……你们自己搞吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_04_0200","text":"…………"}]
